  "description": {
   "en": "A legendary swordsman known as the \"Black Monster\" gets a second chance at life, returning to her youth after decades of seclusion. Haunted by past mistakes—especially her role in a tragic event involving a young saint—she vows to change her path. This time, she decides to protect the saint by becoming her guardian."
